    <string name="about_changelog_text">
• First stable release of Auris.\n\n
• Added custom theme support.\n
• Wallpaper support.\n
• Performance improvements.\n
• Support for Portuguese and English.\n
• You can now make the player transparent by going to Settings > Appearance > Player Theme > Dynamic System.\n
• You can now add wallpapers to Auris. Go to Settings > Appearance, select the Custom Theme, and use the customization panel to personalize the app your way.\n
• Visit the official website below to learn more about Auris and discover all its features.\n\n
Thank you for choosing Auris! ❤️
</string>
